## Installation

### npm

```bash
npm install {{ language.params.npmPackage }}
```

Import the modules you need. The package ships ES modules, CommonJS and TypeScript types:

```js
import {{ '{' }} Client, Account {{ '}' }} from '{{ language.params.npmPackage }}';
```

